{"4286070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phantom of Time", "steam_appid": 4286070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game was created as part of a game jam.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever felt like you are rushing through life? When you purchase this game, you'll feel it even more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ghost that has to escape a level every 10 seconds. Sounds easy? We thought so too. That's why we added special cards that change how the game is played. From extra jumps to camera warping effects, these cards are sure to make the game feel challenging. Every 5 levels, you have to pick a card to continue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect a simple game that you can play casually when you have some free time. We chose a low price so everyone can suffer as much as we did when testing this game. <br><br>Do you think you have what it takes to complete all achievements?  If you do complete them all, send us a message. We want to work with you for our upcoming game 'The Rift Between Us'. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game was created as part of a game jam.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever felt like you are rushing through life? When you purchase this game, you'll feel it even more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ghost that has to escape a level every 10 seconds. Sounds easy? We thought so too. That's why we added special cards that change how the game is played. From extra jumps to camera warping effects, these cards are sure to make the game feel challenging. Every 5 levels, you have to pick a card to continue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect a simple game that you can play casually when you have some free time. We chose a low price so everyone can suffer as much as we did when testing this game. <br><br>Do you think you have what it takes to complete all achievements?  If you d